      "form_guide": "",
      "comment": "UBIQUITOUS (7) broke well and quickly mustered speed to win over the 350m at this track two runs back then prominent throughout when finishing third at Healesville last start. Consistent performer from this draw with a win and two minor placings to his credit. Sure to be about the mark. ZIPPING NUTTALL (2) is a handy dog who jumped from box 4 last time out and scored by 0.7 lengths at this track (24.14). Has won two of two starts from this draw. One of the key runners again. BEAR HAND (1) filled a minor placing last start at Warragul behind Mr. President (22.98) in a Grade 5. Has the early speed to land on the pace and can stick on. Expected to feature. ANCONA (5) cannot be left out over a shorter trip.",
